#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/faq.rst:3
#: 9ce3953a8acc450784ffeeca65664730
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions and Issues"
msgstr "常见问题解答"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/faq.rst:5
#: 8dd55cd5f85f4ec781f2bf24a74ef1f6
msgid ""
"I have random \"noise\" displaying on the console, showing as corrupted "
"text. How do I remove it?"
msgstr "控制台上显示随机 「噪声」，表现为乱码文本，如何消除？"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/faq.rst:7
#: c340eef1d220492b91fa8ad0fa922d12
msgid ""
"MAVProxy will, by default, show corrupted packets. To disable showing them, "
"use ``set shownoise false`` in the MAVProxy console."
msgstr ""
"MAVProxy 默认会显示损坏的数据包。若要禁止显示，请在 MAVProxy 控制台中使用 ``set shownoise false``。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/faq.rst:11
#: 6eed33270a6e42bb99a1cff2c2f47d33
msgid "How do I get MAVProxy to execute specific commands on startup?"
msgstr "如何让 MAVProxy 在启动时执行特定命令？"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/faq.rst:13
#: 30c4d0cda234479fa4ebe0a8ea671b72
msgid "Put the commands in mavinit.scr as per :ref:`here <mavproxy-mavinit>`."
msgstr "按照 :ref:`此处 <mavproxy-mavinit>` 的说明，将命令放入 mavinit.scr 文件中。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/faq.rst:16
#: bcbd1f1a500e4a00846f5422f902f80a
msgid "Which Flight controllers are compatible with MAVProxy?"
msgstr "哪些飞控与 MAVProxy 兼容？"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/faq.rst:18
#: d7edfc564aae4a27ba3aa36fa2d3308b
msgid ""
"The ArduPilot vehicle types (:ref:`ArduPlane <plane:home>`, :ref:`ArduCopter"
" <copter:home>`, :ref:`ArduSub <sub:home>` and :ref:`ArduRover "
"<rover:home>`) are fully compatible. Other Mavlink-based flight controllers "
"(such as the `PX4 <https://px4.io/>`_ stack) should be compatible, but may "
"not show all flight data."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 飞行器类型（:ref:`ArduPlane <plane:home>`、:ref:`ArduCopter "
"<copter:home>`、:ref:`ArduSub <sub:home>` 和 :ref:`ArduRover "
"<rover:home>`）完全兼容。其他基于 MAVLink 的飞控（例如 `PX4 <https://px4.io/>`_ "
"协议栈）应兼容，但可能无法显示所有飞行数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/faq.rst:21
#: 06b3cb167076443481d1a9e8c450ae45
msgid "How do I output a TCP connection to another GCS program?"
msgstr "如何向其他地面站程序输出 TCP 连接？"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/faq.rst:23
#: 635eae634ba545cf884929e3d3e69dd1
msgid ""
"To output a TCP link from MAVProxy to a GCS program (ie. Mission Planner), "
"use the ``--out=tcpin:0.0.0.0:<port>`` commandline option. This will tell "
"MAVProxy to wait for a TCP connection on the specified port. In the other "
"GCS program, configure it to point to the IP address of the device MAVProxy "
"is running on and the port ``<port>``."
msgstr ""
"若要从 MAVProxy 向地面站程序（如 Mission Planner）输出 TCP 链路，请使用 "
"``--out=tcpin:0.0.0.0:<port>`` 命令行选项。这将使 MAVProxy 在指定端口上等待 TCP "
"连接。在其他地面站程序中，将其配置为指向运行 MAVProxy 的设备 IP 地址及端口 ``<port>``。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/faq.rst:25
#: 6b4598b8b1bf40e8b46d58d9d50ddd57
msgid ""
"How do I disable other GCS sub-clients (from ``--out``) from sending "
"commands to the flight controller?"
msgstr "如何禁止其他地面站子客户端（通过 ``--out``）向飞控发送命令？"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/faq.rst:27
#: 4f10717be0d34a6ab1741d064056da68
msgid ""
"The ability to forward commands sent by other sub-clients is enabled by "
"default. It can be disabled by typing ``set mavfwd false``"
msgstr "默认情况下，转发其他子客户端发送命令的功能是启用的。可通过输入 ``set mavfwd false`` 来禁用该功能。"
